CLVP viability is the intersection

\mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{CLVP}} = \mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{causal}} \cap \mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{incentive}} \cap \mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{verification}} \cap \mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{economic}} \cap \mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{equity}}.

