e^*(g^*) = \frac{\lambda s}{c_e} e^{-\kappa g^*} = \frac{\lambda s}{c_e}(1 - \kappa g^*) + O((g^*)^2).

\Delta L(g^*) = e^*(g^*) s = \frac{\lambda s^2}{c_e}(1 - \kappa g^*) + O((\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)^2).

C(e^*, g^*) = \frac{c_e}{2}(e^*)^2 + \frac{c_g}{2}(g^*)^2 = \frac{c_e}{2} \cdot \frac{\lambda^2 s^2}{c_e^2}(1 - 2\kappa g^*) + \frac{c_g}{2}(g^*)^2 + O((g^*)^2)


= \frac{\lambda^2 s^2}{2c_e}(1 - 2\kappa g^*) + O((\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)^2).

Therefore:

W(\kappa) = v \cdot \frac{\lambda s^2}{c_e}(1 - \kappa g^*) - \frac{\lambda^2 s^2}{2c_e}(1 - 2\kappa g^*) + O((\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)^2).

The welfare loss:

\mathcal{L}(\kappa) = W_{\mathrm{IC}} - W(\kappa)


= v \cdot \frac{\lambda s^2}{c_e} \kappa g^* - \frac{\lambda^2 s^2}{2c_e} \cdot 2\kappa g^* + O((\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)^2)


= (v - \lambda)\frac{\lambda s^2}{c_e} \kappa g^* + O((\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)^2).

Substituting $g^* \sim \frac{\lambda^2 s^2}{c_e c_g}(\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)$ and $\kappa \approx \kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} = h_g c_e/(\lambda s^2)$:

\mathcal{L}(\kappa) = (v - \lambda)\frac{\lambda s^2}{c_e} \cdot \frac{h_g c_e}{\lambda s^2} \cdot \frac{\lambda^2 s^2}{c_e c_g}(\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa) + O((\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)^2)


= \frac{(v - \lambda)\lambda^2 s^2 h_g}{c_e c_g}(\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa) + O((\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} - \kappa)^2). \quad \square

