Appendix G. Proofs for Chapter 11: Viability Frontier

G.1 Proof of Theorem C (Verification Viability Frontier)

Statement. Assume $\Pi > 0$. Then $\mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{CLVP}} \neq \varnothing$ iff $\Xi \geq 1$, where $\Xi = \Pi/(c_{\mathrm{test}} \kappa_{\mathrm{crit}}^2)$.

Proof. The viability region is

\mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{CLVP}} = \{\kappa > 0 : \kappa \geq \kappa_{\mathrm{crit}}\} \cap \{\kappa > 0 : V(\kappa) \geq 0\}.

$V(\kappa) = \Pi - c_{\mathrm{test}}\kappa^2 \geq 0 \iff \kappa \leq \kappa_{\max} = \sqrt{\Pi/c_{\mathrm{test}}}$.

The intersection $[\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}}, \infty) \cap [0, \kappa_{\max}]$ is non-empty if and only if $\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} \leq \kappa_{\max}$.

$\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} \leq \kappa_{\max} \iff \kappa_{\mathrm{crit}}^2 \leq \Pi/c_{\mathrm{test}} \iff c_{\mathrm{test}}\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}}^2 \leq \Pi \iff \Xi = \Pi/(c_{\mathrm{test}}\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}}^2) \geq 1$. $\square$

G.2 Derivation of the Benchmark Form of $\Xi$

Substituting $\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}} = h_g c_e/(\lambda s^2)$ and $c_{\mathrm{test}} = c_1 \sigma_\eta^2 z_\alpha^2/q^2$:

\Xi = \frac{\Pi}{c_{\mathrm{test}}\kappa_{\mathrm{crit}}^2} = \frac{\Pi}{(c_1 \sigma_\eta^2 z_\alpha^2/q^2) \cdot (h_g c_e/(\lambda s^2))^2} = \frac{\Pi \lambda^2 s^4 q^2}{c_1 \sigma_\eta^2 z_\alpha^2 h_g^2 c_e^2}.

With $\Pi = \lambda^2 s^2/c_e$:

\Xi_{\mathrm{benchmark}} = \frac{\lambda^2 s^2}{c_e} \cdot \frac{\lambda^2 s^4 q^2}{c_1 \sigma_\eta^2 z_\alpha^2 h_g^2 c_e^2} = \frac{\lambda^4 s^6 q^2}{c_1 \sigma_\eta^2 z_\alpha^2 h_g^2 c_e^3}.

Define $\Lambda = \lambda^4 s^6/(c_1 \sigma_\eta^2 z_\alpha^2 c_e^3)$ and $\rho_M = q/h_g$:

\Xi_{\mathrm{benchmark}} = \Lambda \cdot \rho_M^2. \quad \square

